WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.320
Hi, I'm Stacey Miller.

2
00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:05.160
Life can change in a second.

3
00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:07.750
I know because mine did.

4
00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:10.930
15 years ago, I lost my sight,

5
00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:12.380
but I kept my vision.

6
00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:16.830
Now I help Texas families protect the people they love.

7
00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:21.160
I'd love to hear your story and help you protect the people in it.
